<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  2,564 (LDD)  8,436   M.V.Yuan Da	   16/12</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  5,919 (LDD)  6,081   Tae Dong Gang	 17/12</p>
<p> Rice Loading	   Nil</p>
<p>Others</p>
